[SI_INTERFACE_OPTIONS_ACT_SETTING_LABEL_TOOLTIP] = "Controls the display of helpful combat tips at the bottom of the Heads Up Display. When automatic display is chosen, it will only be shown when necessary to learn the core mechanics of combat."
