[SI_INTERFACE_OPTIONS_COMBAT_QUICK_CAST_GROUND_ABILITIES_TOOLTIP] = "Toggle whether all ground targeted abilities are cast instantly or if they require a second confirmation with the location indicator displayed.  Automatic defaults each ground targeted ability to its own pre-defined setting."
